Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:08:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Differentiate Assistant IA and Griotte

- IA: summaries, debates, daily help, content ideas; redirects proverbs/tradition to Griotte
- Griotte: proverbs, tradition, culture only; redirects summaries/debates/code/news to the IA
- Per-mode temperature (IA 0.2, Griotte 0.5; BAARO_AI_TEMPERATURE still overrides)
- Presets/follow-ups/welcome text updated, dead web-search suggestions removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XttQVh8guyrdFTtm9S8eUN
---
